1
00:00:05,547 --> 00:00:07,424
At long last,

2
00:00:10,093 --> 00:00:11,178
we can begin.

3
00:00:24,191 --> 00:00:25,859
We're really starting to lose it.

4
00:00:26,401 --> 00:00:27,528
Being stuck in here.

5
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:30,531
No end in sight.

6
00:00:32,824 --> 00:00:34,326
Maybe tonight is our break.

7
00:00:36,787 --> 00:00:37,788
We find Vecna.

8
00:00:38,539 --> 00:00:40,290
And we end this once and for all.

9
00:00:40,374 --> 00:00:41,208
Together.

10
00:00:52,427 --> 00:00:54,721
This isn't like
one of your campaigns.

11
00:00:56,598 --> 00:00:58,475
You don't get to write the ending.

12
00:00:59,184 --> 00:01:00,227
Not this time.

13
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:05,315
He's planning to end our world.

14
00:01:07,526 --> 00:01:08,986
And he's not gonna stop

15
00:01:09,695 --> 00:01:12,072
until we're drained
of every last ounce of suffering.

16
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:46,023
We stay true to ourselves.

17
00:01:47,858 --> 00:01:49,693
We stay true to our friends.

18
00:01:49,776 --> 00:01:50,611
Do it.

19
00:01:53,614 --> 00:01:54,865
No matter the cost.

20
00:01:58,076 --> 00:01:59,119
Look out!

21
00:02:10,505 --> 00:02:11,590
William,

22
00:02:13,258 --> 00:02:15,010
you are going to help me…

23
00:02:21,099 --> 00:02:24,936
one last time.

